{"id":"u-b693e711-923d-4dbc-aa89-0e374480daae","src":"community","title":"Marathon Supplemental Strength Training","author":"Steven W.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/nkGl83-marathon-supplemental-strength-training","desc":"Supplemental strength training program to maintain strength and (hopefully, no guarantees) prevent injury when training for a marathon. It is a modification of the \"Runner's Peak Mileage Template\" in Finish Strong: Resistance Training for Endurance Athletes by Boergers and Gingerelli. It was modified to accommodate my 5x/week run schedule, and to avoid taking up three power racks at a time for supersets (don't be that guy!). Exercises are capped at RPE8 to limit fatigue. \n\nDay 1 is a Recovery Day. Why is it Day 1? Because my Long Run day is Saturday, and Boostcamp's week starts on Sunday. \nDay 2 is called \"Get It\". I think that's self explanatory?","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":43,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-15T03:52:47.057Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Recovery/Easy Day","Get It"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Inverted Row","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Plank Pull Through","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8},{"r":8,"rpe":8},{"r":6,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":3}],"note":"Negatives: 5 sec down"}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dorsiflexion With Band","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Standing Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dead Bug","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Side Plank","sets":[{"sec":30,"x":3}]},{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8},{"r":8,"rpe":8},{"r":6,"rpe":8}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Assisted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Over